    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Заготовка на завтра сама себя сделает?",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Есть, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я иду на кухню.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The secret is out. Dima wanted to sell Claude Monet! Let's see what happens next. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'to happen' and 'why' — you will catch every word right away. See you in the next scene.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "До встречи!",
      "gap": 0.3
